<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 3-MO BUBOR DOWN 0.05PCT, 1-MO DOWN 0.01PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 3-MO BUBOR DOWN 0.05PCT, 1-MO DOWN 0.01PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) dropped by 0.05 percentage point for the three-month maturity and by 0.01 percentage point for one month, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR was fixed by the NBH at 23.49 percent for the one month and 23.45 for the three months maturity.</p>
<p>The NBH began calculating BUBOR on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 266 2410</p>
